      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "You have a press, a pistol, a revolver, a shotgun, a rifle and steel armor. LV is done. The next gate is aluminum, and with it come automatic weapons, grenades with real fragments, and the first serious armor.\n\nAluminum is a GregTech project in its own right: bauxite, electrolysis, and an MV power setup. Take your time. Everything you built here keeps working at MV, and a higher-tier machine runs lower-tier recipes faster.\n\nHold four aluminum plates to close the chapter and take the big loot bag. Spend some of the winnings on ammo, because MV guns burn through it.\n\n[note]The MV chapter opens from the pack\u0027s MV quests, not from this one. You can start it any time.[/note]",
